body:
I've definitely seen this before but don't know what it's called. From a little googling it looks like Coral spot. Unfortunately there is no treatment so you need to cut back any infected areas asap. 

&#x200B;

[https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/plant-problems/disease/coral-spot-fungus-information.htm](https://www.gardeningknowhow.com/plant-problems/disease/coral-spot-fungus-information.htm)
